<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-26T12:56:39.717Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:56:39 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant attacks continue across Nigeria, with suspected militants killing at least 30 people in Niger state and gunmen killing 16 in a midnight raid on Bassa community in Plateau. Bandits abducted six people in Kaduna and six in Chikun LGA, while gunmen opened fire on Peter Obi’s rally in Edo, injuring one person. President Tinubu vowed to rescue abducted schoolchildren in Borno and ordered an onslaught against terrorists. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/nigeria-s-upcoming-election-marred-by-rising-ai-disinformation/a-79946897?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOUW5aeXpDUldIYjR5RlZ2bVdyUHFKZUtRcEUwTERNc3ZTRVFWTlNRSEZjV05VMVNyNG1KTXZNelVaQUJVaUlObUlqYXl5MV85b0hrTDdJMlA4YVcyanRXVVhrV19vUjBqRmR2WDBzcnY2MlFsTjdoS0paNGFTQWdESk5Lcm9GeWNSbUN6dkJwbDhwWk5WR1FqWXVWS1dYVjFVcElvNDd2RS11NnprbVVUdWl3cVVkVC16?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxOY1FmbWFmYkZPWjc4eTRjeGZvck03UTV0bEJiMTJNLUxXWU5WdDlGUm05U2dWaVV1MXZ2ZnNhREhzQ1U4V0E3SlAtZmNrd1Q4TmxDVEFvLUJrOV9LVE5XWHBpZ0hzaWhhQnc5S1U3NVp0WXBRNjR2eGlLbVhfQWpMWWpQb0hNUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTE9zbUVXaEllV0tLc19nN2VZUlRKaGZxX0hGbUdNZFpja2hjbVlobUJvdmFKZHQ0Y0Itek45MWRONkg5MXY4S1o3UDdqUFFkYk9kUG1tT0xKc2p2dkxEekhXUktFckJPQTl1N0dJRGJmcFU3TkZyMDVZTg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Trust&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Tribune Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxNTjRVbnBRcFo3c1FSTDYtRTdCRTZQSko2dGlrRVlJQTBlOVhxanZRZ0VQS1pKVTV5Tmt0X3diWUlTUUJaaFVvUU9GYi1hNTd3TXo1alowZ1JLZ1h3VWd